        <title type="html"><![CDATA[`anchor-name`: add `position_after_layout` behavioral subfeature]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29282</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29282"/>
        <updated>2026-03-17T16:15:02.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">This captures the specification change, where anchor positioning happens after layout, such as zooms or transforms. Originally reported in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3650713048" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499">#28499</a>.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">This spec change occurred in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1625424788" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584/hovercard?comment_id=3109444615&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584#issuecomment-3109444615">w3c/csswg-drafts#8584 (comment)</a>. The spec text can be found in <a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-anchor-position/#anchor-position-size:~:text=The%20anchor%20box%E2%80%99s%20position%20and%20size%20is%20determined%20after%20layout%2E" rel="nofollow">the paragraph beginning with</a>:</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">The anchor box’s position and size is determined after layout.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Chromium appears to be the only engine implementing. See <a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/382294252#comment7" rel="nofollow">Chromium bug 1993692 (comment #7)</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993692" rel="nofollow">Firefox bug 1993692</a> tracks this in Gecko.</p>
<p dir="auto">I found three related bugs against WebKit, but none are confirmed or accepted. Since I don't know which one will ultimately be worked on, I used them all for <code class="notranslate">impl_url</code>. See related issues below for a complete list.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #28499.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3650713048" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499">#28499</a></li>
<li>Toward <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3647585549" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558/hovercard?comment_id=3647042903&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558#issuecomment-3647042903">web-platform-dx/web-features#3558 (comment)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/382294252#comment7" rel="nofollow">Chromium bug 382294252</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993692" rel="nofollow">Firefox bug 1993692</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=289743" rel="nofollow">WebKit bug 289743</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=309921" rel="nofollow">WebKit bug 309921</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=307660" rel="nofollow">WebKit bug 307660</a></li>
</ul>

]]></content>
