        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF149 CSS text-box -edge/-trim behind pref]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29274</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29274"/>
        <updated>2026-03-17T04:50:49.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF149 adds support for the shorthand CSS property <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">text-box</code></a> , corresponding longhand properties <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box-trim" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">text-box-trim</code></a> and <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box-edge" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">text-box-edge</code></a>, and the value <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/text-edge" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">text-edge</code></a> behind the preference <code class="notranslate">layout.css.text-box.enabled</code> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013458" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013458</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This updates the features. Collector tests appear to pass when the pref is enabled:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-trim" rel="nofollow">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-trim</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-edge" rel="nofollow">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-edge</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box" rel="nofollow">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3977998210" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43208" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43208/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43208">mdn/content#43208</a></p>]]></content>
