<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">position-anchor: normal</code> was the initial value, but now it's spec'd as <code class="notranslate">position-anchor: none</code>. This covers the discrepancy between browsers.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">I didn't actually test this, I just figured it out based on the bugs and it aligned with the support data for <code class="notranslate">none</code>.</p>


