        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF149 adds support for CSS <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/font-family#math" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">font-family: math</code></a> property and applies it by default to the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/MathML/Reference/Element/math" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">&lt;math&gt;</code></a> SVG element in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2014703" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2014703</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This follows on from <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4069112122" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29250" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29250/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29250">#29250</a> which added the note about the font-family. It adds info about versions that use the font family for math element.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3977999905" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43209" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43209/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43209">mdn/content#43209</a></p>]]></content>
